Sped up content app lookups (the `index.html` probe, directory listings and exact file lookups) by checking repository membership per matching row instead of across the whole repository version, backed by a new index on `ContentArtifact.relative_path`. `RepositoryVersion.get_content()` now selects membership through the `RepositoryContent` version interval instead of unnesting `content_ids`. The `index.html` probe is skipped for file paths.
